# Dialog Backdrop Dismiss

## Rules

1. **View-only dialogs** (detail/read-only, delete confirms) — outer backdrop click **closes** the dialog.
2. **Add/Edit form dialogs** (unsaved draft in dialog) — outer backdrop click **does not** close; user must use Close (X) or Apply/Save.

## Implementation

- Prefer shared `DetailDialog` from `components/shared/detail-dialog.tsx`.
- View-only: `mode="view"` (default) or `dismissOnBackdrop={true}`.
- Add/Edit forms: `mode="form"` or `dismissOnBackdrop={false}`.
- Do not hand-roll modal backdrops with `onClick={onClose}` on form dialogs.
- Drawers (`Drawer`) are view-only; backdrop dismiss stays enabled.

## Examples

```tsx
// View-only detail
<DetailDialog title="Company detail" onClose={onClose}>
  ...
</DetailDialog>

// Add/Edit form
<DetailDialog mode="form" title="Edit link" onClose={onClose}>
  ...
</DetailDialog>
```
